Template: indi-allsky/camera_interface
Type: select
Choices: indi, libcamera, simulator, mqtt
Default: indi
Description: Select primary camera interface:
 Choose the camera capture subsystem for indi-allsky.
 .
  * indi: Standard INDI camera drivers (ZWO ASI, QHY, PlayerOne, ToupTek, SVBony, DSLR)
  * libcamera: Raspberry Pi native libcamera subsystem
  * simulator: Simulated test camera for demonstration/testing
  * mqtt: Remote MQTT camera stream

Template: indi-allsky/ccd_driver
Type: select
Choices: indi_simulator_ccd, indi_asi_ccd, indi_playerone_ccd, indi_toupcam_ccd, indi_svbony_ccd, indi_qhy_ccd, indi_gphoto_ccd, indi_v4l2_ccd, indi_webcam_ccd
Default: indi_simulator_ccd
Description: Select INDI CCD camera driver:
 Choose the specific INDI CCD driver for your camera hardware.

Template: indi-allsky/http_port
Type: string
Default: 80
Description: Web server HTTP port:
 Port number used by the web server (Apache/Nginx) for standard HTTP traffic.

Template: indi-allsky/https_port
Type: string
Default: 443
Description: Web server HTTPS port:
 Port number used by the web server (Apache/Nginx) for secure HTTPS traffic.

Template: indi-allsky/indi_port
Type: string
Default: 7624
Description: INDI server port:
 Port number used by the local indiserver daemon to accept camera connections.

Template: indi-allsky/web_user
Type: string
Default: admin
Description: Initial web admin username:
 Username for the administrative account in the indi-allsky web interface.

Template: indi-allsky/web_pass
Type: password
Description: Initial web admin password (minimum 8 characters):
 Enter a password for the administrative account. It must be at least 8 characters long.

Template: indi-allsky/web_pass_confirm
Type: password
Description: Confirm web admin password:
 Please enter the same admin password again to confirm.

Template: indi-allsky/password_too_short
Type: error
Description: Password is too short
 The password must be at least 8 characters long. Please try again.

Template: indi-allsky/password_mismatch
Type: error
Description: Passwords do not match
 The two passwords you entered did not match. Please try again.

Template: indi-allsky/web_email
Type: string
Default: admin@example.org
Description: Web admin contact email address:
 Contact email address for the initial web administrator account.

Template: indi-allsky/latitude
Type: string
Default: 0.0
Description: Observatory Latitude (-90.0 to 90.0):
 Geographical latitude in decimal degrees for celestial calculations and solar/lunar ephemeris.

Template: indi-allsky/longitude
Type: string
Default: 0.0
Description: Observatory Longitude (-180.0 to 180.0):
 Geographical longitude in decimal degrees for celestial calculations and solar/lunar ephemeris.

Template: indi-allsky/elevation
Type: string
Default: 0.0
Description: Observatory Elevation in meters:
 Height above sea level in meters for the observatory site.

Template: indi-allsky/oidc_enable
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Enable OIDC (OpenID Connect) Single Sign-On?
 Select true to enable OpenID Connect single sign-on authentication for the web interface.

Template: indi-allsky/oidc_client_id
Type: string
Description: OIDC Client ID:
 Client ID configured in your OpenID Connect identity provider (e.g., Keycloak, Authentik, Authelia, Google).

Template: indi-allsky/oidc_client_secret
Type: password
Description: OIDC Client Secret:
 Client Secret configured in your OpenID Connect identity provider.

Template: indi-allsky/oidc_discovery_url
Type: string
Description: OIDC Discovery URL (.well-known/openid-configuration):
 Full OpenID Connect discovery endpoint URL (e.g. https://auth.example.com/.well-known/openid-configuration).
